    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Berlin-based freelance art director and graphic designer. Worked at Apple (communications/marketing creative team, ~2020), then ~3 yrs at bus.group (Kreuzberg, Berlin) before going fully freelance. Solo practice covers art direction, graphic design, identity, and custom typography (lettering, logotypes, bespoke typefaces for branding). Clients include Apple, Adidas, Carhartt, Harvard, Jean Paul Gaultier, Lacoste, MTV Germany, Paris Saint-Germain, Supreme, TikTok. Long-running collaborator with Leonhard Laupichler and Philipp Bulk; co-editor of \"New Aesthetic\" type publication (Vols I-III, with Laupichler via Sorry Press). Freelance confirmed: site + Brand Identity interview agree; LinkedIn matches. Mid-career, approx. 5-6 yrs experience; works at senior-independent level, capable of managing client briefs and commissioning partners. Autonomy 4 (set_by agent): runs own freelance practice with major brand clients, commissions collaborators, edits a publication; not yet at creative director of a team scale.",
